#     is reconciled before it is written (retire, then add). "다시 하자"
#     has ONE path, `restart`. No "later" button or sentence, no emoji.
#
# LANES (D10). LLM lane: carrying the user's words into the `answer` payload,
# and naming lifts (with Korean display names) in the one `compose` step. RULE
# lane: which move is next, every sentence, every dose, validation, the write
